                                "sense_id": "b12ebc4c-6d7a-350c-b073-e9db7dbb15b0",
                                "text": "extraordinary borrowing had been so extensive, Joly de Fleury reckoned, that even if it were amortized over the following decade, the state would still be running an annual deficit of over 50 million livres."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
